  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Wildlife Conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The U.S. Agency for International Developments (USAID) supports Vietnam to protect wildlife populations in its remaining strongholds of intact forest through a series of projects: Biodiversity Conservation, Saving Threatened Wildlife, USAID Mekong Delta Coastal Habitat Conservation, Conserving Threatened Species in Hanoi City, and Sustainable Wildlife Conservation. Our Sustainable Wildlife Conservation project, in collaboration with local authorities, communities, and stakeholders, strengthens conservation efforts in Dong Nai province and Hanoi to protect wildlife and raise public awareness about the consequences of illegal wildlife consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
